      ],
      "name": "displayName",
      "fail_if_empty": false,
      "description": "Microsoft ends the memberOf preview for dynamic groups on 3 November 2026. Groups that still use it stop updating and keep stale membership, which can leave outdated app access, Conditional Access targeting, Microsoft 365 access or licence assignment in place.",
      "remediation": "In the Entra admin center > Groups > All groups, open each listed group, record its membership and what depends on it, then replace the memberOf rule with attribute-based rules or convert the group to assigned membership.",
